{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方第一块白色大字，红色的“心里热了”“有劲头”尤其醒目；随后中部紫色大字和下部绿色大字也会争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"像是一个想起从前亲近的日子，重新鼓起劲、想把往后的日子过好的人；但这是否代表此刻的最终状态不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心里发热、振奋、有劲头。\",\n  \"missed\": \"中间关于害怕很久才遇见亲近的人、心渐渐平静的变化，以及最后关于即使没有亲近的人也要好好生活、不为留人委屈自己的态度。右上角当前选中的阶段指向最后这个方向，但字号较小。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三块彩色大句字号和亮度接近，争夺主视线，不容易第一眼确定哪一块代表当前核心状态。\",\n    \"三块分别呈现回忆后的温热振奋、对亲近关系的担忧、珍惜他人但不委屈求全，核心状态需要在几块之间拼接。\",\n    \"每块大字下面都有连续的小字说明，需要在多条信息中筛选，增加扫读负担。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bbdca335-86da-4eff-82c5-9b1b71a54505", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T023835744769Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:39:16.653003+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6c7f20508faf8bba3946021755ce55e1a5319ad84803f7f60b897b688c303305", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4a